_assets/steam/apps/2842530/extras/c4ff87b5f9efe6086580ead4c9950844.poster.avif?t=1731803729\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842530/extras/c4ff87b5f9efe6086580ead4c9950844.webm?t=1731803729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842530/extras/c4ff87b5f9efe6086580ead4c9950844.mp4?t=1731803729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>At the beginning of each match, the player is faced with the choice of an aspiration. This choice defines a powerful initial item for your journey. The goal is to build an incredible deck to overcome all temptations and obstacles, ultimately achieving the chosen aspiration.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build Your Deck: After each battle, choose wisely from over 200 cards to build a deck that adapts to your strategy and the ever-changing environment.<br></li><li>Random Events: Encounter unpredictable events, each with multiple choices that can directly impact your progression.<br></li><li>Strategic Choices: Make wise decisions when interacting with events, items, and cards to maximize your chances of success.<br></li><li>Unlockables: Expand your card collection as you progress, unlocking new possibilities with each match and enhancing your deck.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extreme Replayability</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 initial aspirations.<br></li><li>50+ random events.<br></li><li>200+ implemented cards.<br></li><li>100+ different items to discover.<br></li><li>50+ unique battles.</li></ul>",
